{"URL": "https://banyakresepi.blogspot.com/2016/06/cara-buat-ais-limau-asam-boi.html", "Page_Title": "Cara Buat Ais Limau Asam Boi", "Publish_Date": "2016-06", "Number_of_Commentary": 0, "Page_description": [["", "", "Cara Buat Ais Limau Asam Boi!!", " | Waktu berbuka puasa, benda yang korang buat minum dulu kan? Maklum la, tekak dah terlalu kering. Segelas konpem tak cukup, kalau boleh satu jug nak minum. Apa kata hari ni minuman untuk berbuka puasa tu cuba resepi ", "Ais Limau Asam Boi", " pulak. Tak payah nak singgah gerai tepi jalan untuk beli. Buat sendiri sebab mudah, murah dan nak minum bergelas-gelas pun takde hal la. Aku pun nak cuba buat hari ni."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Selamat mencuba.."], ["", "Jangan lupa share.."], ["", "InsyaALLAH peroleh pahala.."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Sumber : ", "Nieza Norhamnira"], ["", "Oleh :\u00a0", "Nick Nashram"], ["", "", "Cara Buat Ais Limau Asam Boi!!"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], [""], ["", "", "", ""], [""], [""], [""], [""], [""], [""]]}
