{"URL": "https://banyakresepi.blogspot.com/2017/02/resepi-cheesy-boat-sedap.html", "Page_Title": "Resepi Cheesy Boat Sedap", "Publish_Date": "2017-02", "Number_of_Commentary": 0, "Page_description": [["", "", "Resepi Cheesy Boat Sedap!!", "\u00a0|\u00a0Assalamualaikum, jom sama-sama mencuba.. Asyik roti john je.., Cuba try ", "Cheesy Boat", " plak. Uii sedapp!\u00a0, \u00a0Jom..."], ["", ""], ["", "Macam biasa, resepi disediakan di bawah\u00a0", "Step by Step (SbS)"], ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "", "", "Sumber : \u200e", "Habeebah Md Daud", "", ""], ["", "Sumber : \u200e", "Habeebah Md Daud"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "", "Bahannya:"], ["", ""], ["", "3 sosej ", "(gorengkan sekejap)"], ["", "3biji telur\u00a0"], ["", "1/4 cawan susu segar"], ["", "Mozarella"], ["", "Roti bagguette"], ["", "Sedikit garam"], ["", "Pepper"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Combine semua sekali kecuali mozarella, dan kacau\u00a0"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Kiri sebelum, kanan selepas."], ["", ""], ["", "Buatkan ruang di tengah-tengah ala bentuk sampan/boat."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Tuangkan semua yang dikacau sebati ke dalam roti. Jangan risau xkan tumpah. Sebab roti serap telur dan susu.\u00a0"], ["", ""], ["", "Taburkan Mozarella"], ["", "", "Optional: tabur paprika / daun bawang\u00a0"], ["", ""], ["", "Bakar dalam oven 160c, 20 minit."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Siappp!!!!"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Crunchy kat luar dalam lembut jer rasa telur dalam roti. Sesuai makan dengan sos cili.."], ["", ""], ["", "Selamat mencuba.."], ["", "Jangan lupa share.."], ["", ""], ["", ""], [""], ["", "", "", ""], [""], [""], [""], [""], [""], [""]]}
{"URL": "https://banyakresepi.blogspot.com/2017/02/resepi-spaghetti-carbonara-terbaik.html", "Page_Title": "Resepi Spaghetti Carbonara Terbaik", "Publish_Date": "2017-02", "Number_of_Commentary": 0, "Page_description": [["", "", "Resepi Spaghetti Carbonara Terbaik!!", "\u00a0| Bismillah arini lunch ", "Western", ".. anak teruna request nak makan spaghetti carbonara plak dah. Erm dah pndai dah la ni request nak makan itu ini. Ibu ikutkan je la... jomm sesiapa nak resepi tengok kat pic step by step yer. Hahaha ni ", "spaghetti carbonara", " versi say ayer.. guna apa yang ada je la janji anak-anak maan pastu puji lak sedap pun ibu rsa kembang hidung dah. Hihihi"], ["", ""], ["", "Macam biasa, resepi disediakan di bawah Step by Step (SbS)...", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "Resepi oleh :\u00a0", "Ana Mariana Ismail", "", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Resepi oleh :\u00a0", "Ana Mariana Ismail"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Ok ni dia bahan-bahan untuk buat spaghetti carbonara kita. Mesti la kena ada spaghetti kan.. susu full cream, chicken mushroom soup, slice mushrooms, sosej, cheese, brokoli, bawang putih, lada sulah dengan ", "mix herbs", "."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Ok mula-mula didihkan air pastu masukkan sedikit minyak pastu celur spaghetti sampai lembut elok pastu toskan. Pastu rebus jap sosej dengan brokoli toskan."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Ok untuk kuah pulak panaskan sedikit minyak pastu tumis bawang putih sampai naik bau ok. Kalau ada minyak zaitun lagi sedap"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Pastu masukkan lak sedikit susu..biarkan mendidih."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Pastu masukkan pula chicken mushroom soup kita.. masukkan sedikit air kacau-kacau sampai sebati & mendidih."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Pastu masukkan slice mushrooms.."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Masukkan slice cheese.. jangan banyak sangat nanti muak pulak kan.."], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "Pastu masukkan sosej & br